{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">觀塘 apm 商場昨日（26 日）爆發一宗涉及兩家人的混戰事件。網上流傳片段顯示，一名中年婦人突推撞及掌摑一名小童，致小童倒地；另一名黑衣女子隨即上前理論爆發爭執，場面混亂，吸引大批市民圍觀。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-10h45m06s091.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026OVEJnqnCK71787799120.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-10h45m06s091.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據悉，事件源於一名 68 歲梁姓婦人與 34 歲吳姓女兒帶同男外孫到商場玩耍期間，男童與一名 5 歲內地女童因使用遊戲設施發生爭執。68 歲老婦疑出手掌摑女童，女童的 34 歲母親見狀隨即上前理論並出手，最終演變成兩家 3 名女子互相襲擊。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-10h45m08s195.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026i6LZtfZ4ed1787799128.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-10h45m08s195.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">警方接報到場調查，發現涉事男童母親面部有紅痕、女童臉部紅腫，而女童母親眼角亦告紅腫。警方先以涉嫌「普通襲擊」及「襲擊致造成身體傷害」拘捕68歲男童祖母、34歲女童母親，及後經過調查再拘捕34歲男童母親。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-10h45m14s782.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026s3Gh9FrpuU1787799135.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-10h45m14s782.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段曝光後引發大批網民熱議，不少人指責大人向小朋友動手的行為極度離譜，留言怒轟：「點都唔應該打細路」、「黐咗線，打到瞓地」及「真係離晒大譜」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T03:20:16.752348+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":391,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}